*> Harness-only MQGET: one request per line of $MQREQ (padded to 1000).
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. MQGET.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT REQ-FILE ASSIGN TO DYNAMIC WS-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD REQ-FILE.
01 REQ-REC PIC X(1000).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-PATH PIC X(256).
01 WS-OPEN PIC X VALUE 'N'.
01 WS-EOF PIC X VALUE 'N'.
01 WS-SEQ PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 L-HCONN PIC S9(9) BINARY.
01 L-HOBJ PIC S9(9) BINARY.
01 L-MD.
   05 L-FORMAT PIC X(8).
   05 L-CCSID PIC S9(9) BINARY.
   05 L-MSGID PIC X(24).
   05 L-CORRELID PIC X(24).
   05 L-REPLYTOQ PIC X(48).
01 L-GMO PIC X(8).
01 L-BUFLEN PIC S9(9) BINARY.
01 L-BUFFER PIC X(1000).
01 L-DATALEN PIC S9(9) BINARY.
01 L-CC PIC S9(9) BINARY.
01 L-RC PIC S9(9) BINARY.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-HCONN L-HOBJ L-MD L-GMO L-BUFLEN L-BUFFER
                         L-DATALEN L-CC L-RC.
    IF WS-OPEN = 'N'
       ACCEPT WS-PATH FROM ENVIRONMENT 'MQREQ'
       OPEN INPUT REQ-FILE
       MOVE 'Y' TO WS-OPEN
    END-IF
    IF WS-EOF = 'N'
       READ REQ-FILE AT END MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF END-READ
    END-IF
    IF WS-EOF = 'Y'
       MOVE 2 TO L-CC
       MOVE 2033 TO L-RC
    ELSE
       ADD 1 TO WS-SEQ
       MOVE SPACES TO L-MSGID L-CORRELID
       STRING 'MSG' WS-SEQ DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO L-MSGID END-STRING
       STRING 'CORR' WS-SEQ DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO L-CORRELID END-STRING
       MOVE 'CARD.DEMO.CLIENT.REPLY' TO L-REPLYTOQ
       MOVE REQ-REC TO L-BUFFER
       MOVE 1000 TO L-DATALEN
       MOVE 0 TO L-CC L-RC
    END-IF
    GOBACK.
